  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - West Sumbawa Wind Power Plant Feasibility Study, through UL Services Group LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for PT. Medco Power Indonesia (Medco), a private energy developer, to support the development of a 111.3 megawatt wind power plant in West Sumbawa in West Nusa Tenggara, Indonesia (Project). Implementation of the Project would support Indonesia&apos;s clean energy transition under the Just Energy Transition Partnership (JETP) by providing an alternative to fossil fuel energy sources.</narrative>
  </description>
